  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Twelfth Hair tells Lian Ke Xin that the valley where Sixth Hair lives is specially arranged by master as a forbidden area in the sovereign immortal aperture, and that they call it the Spectral Valley Forbidden Ground. He also says Sixth Hair is Spectral Soul Demon Venerable’s clone, affected by master’s method, imprisoned for life and unable to stop refining Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        2245
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_twelfth_hair",
        "char_lian_ke_xin",
        "char_sixth_hair",
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Within the Spectral Valley Forbidden Ground, Sixth Hair is thin as a stick, with caved-in cheeks and deep eye bags, right after refining rank seven master-servant Gu. He recounts thirty-three failures, twenty-seven heavy injuries, and nineteen near deaths, then prepares to keep refining so Shadow Sect grows stronger and the main body can be saved. His state of mind is not right; after mumbling he returns to refining other Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
